{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras/3c0b4bc59a8c055995fbec5f991af473.avif?t=1770382429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras_big/3c0b4bc59a8c055995fbec5f991af473.avif?t=1770382429 width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dreams of Earth</i>    is a multi-ending sci-fi romance visual novel (ADV) set in a futuristic world. It tells the story of Nameless, an astronaut from a distant planet, and Xiaoxi, a bionic girl from Azure Star Academy. The game explores themes of bionic humans, pure romance, and teacher-student relationships, with an estimated playtime of 6\u20138 hours, featuring rich storytelling and numerous CG illustrations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras/1590bc7529c2af20f7e9a3465842c878.avif?t=1770382429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras_big/1590bc7529c2af20f7e9a3465842c878.avif?t=1770382429 width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras/a7c301af10a7f2e59e95d341bfeab108.avif?t=1770382429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras_big/a7c301af10a7f2e59e95d341bfeab108.avif?t=1770382429 width=800 height=539 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras/6a5cffdbc93ae376832682c265cc6060.avif?t=1770382429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras_big/6a5cffdbc93ae376832682c265cc6060.avif?t=1770382429 width=800 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras/3fb944df46fd7a90c3d39a39002d7c7f.avif?t=1770382429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras_big/3fb944df46fd7a90c3d39a39002d7c7f.avif?t=1770382429 width=800 height=2446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras/edf358e4004aeb69c96dd512066099df.avif?t=1770382429\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376290/extras_big/edf358e4004aeb69c96dd512066099df.avif?t=1770382429 width=800 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are PygmaGame, an independent Chinese visual novel (galgame) development team. Our team members previously worked on <i>Shore of Sky</i>. Inspired by works such as <i>Planetarian</i>, <i>Stella of the End</i>, and <i>ATRI -My Dear Moments-</i>, combined with the lead writer's passion for science fiction and extensive reading of Golden Age sci-fi classics (plus, bionic humans are adorable), we set out to create this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STAFF LIST\uff1a</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Director</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u8fb0\u706b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Scriptwriter</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u5267\u672c&amp;\u6f14\u51fa\uff1a\u8fb0\u706b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u5267\u672c\u534f\u529b\uff1aR\u53f7\u673a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>PROGRAMMER</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>\u4e3b\u7a0b\u5e8f\uff1a\u7a7a\u767d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI\u7a0b\u5e8f\uff1a\u5b64\u665a\u7684\u7231\u4e0a\u591c\u665a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u7a0b\u5e8f\u534f\u529b\uff1a\u6d45\u5531</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>ART</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u4eba\u7269\u7acb\u7ed8&amp;CG\u63d2\u753b\uff1aRatto</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u673a\u5668\u4eba\u7acb\u7ed8\uff1a\u3086\u9f8d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u573a\u666f\u63d2\u753b\uff1a34</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q\u7248\u63d2\u753b\uff1a\u3086\u9f8d\u3001\u6d6e\u6e38</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI\u8bbe\u8ba1\uff1a\u51b7\u6de1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>VA</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u5c0f\u5e0ccv\uff1a\u4e91\u751f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u5f71cv\uff1a\u6a31\u9171</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>MUSIC</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PV\u97f3\u4e50\uff1a\u96e8\u89c2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>BGM\u3001\u97f3\u6548\u6536\u96c6\uff1aR\u53f7\u673a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>OTHER</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>PV\u5236\u4f5c\uff1aSeason</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u4e3b\u9898\u66f2\uff08ed\uff09\u5236\u4f5c\uff1aWhilist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u5468\u8fb9\u5236\u4f5c\uff1a\u4e88\u8587</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>OTHER HELP</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u6d45\u5531\u3001\u65e0\u8bed\u6b7b\u4e86\u3001\u7956\u5b89\u9752\u5e74\u3001\u82cf\u683c\u62c9\u6ca1\u6709\u5e95\u3001\u8fbe\u74e6\u91cc\u6c0f\u3001\u672c\u5915\u3001\u5c0f\u6c34\u661f\u3001\u663c\u4f0f\u591c\u51fa\u7684\u9eef\u767d\u732b\u732b\u3001\u5fc6\u4e0e\u79cb\u53f6\u3001\u6e05\u5f08\u4e91\u65f6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>THANKS</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u901a\u8fc7\u6469\u70b9\u8d5e\u52a9\u300a\u6d77\u84dd\u661f\u4e4b\u68a6\u300b\u7684\u5404\u4f4d\u73a9\u5bb6\uff01</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u5760\u843d\u4e4b\u65f6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.c